/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Longo 21 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 06\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 06\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 06\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando, onde e a que horas se realiza o Trail da Rabanada 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Trail da Rabanada 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong>Campo de Futebol de Romariz<\/strong>, em Santa Maria da Feira (Aveiro). Os hor\u00e1rios de partida s\u00e3o: <strong>14:30<\/strong> para o Trail Longo (21 km), <strong>14:45<\/strong> para o Trail (12 km) e <strong>15:00<\/strong> para a Caminhada (8 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para o Trail da Rabanada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 <strong>6 de dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59<\/strong> divididas em duas fases: na <strong>1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 15 de novembro)<\/strong> custam <strong>12,00 \u20ac<\/strong> no Trail Longo 21 km, <strong>10,00 \u20ac<\/strong> no Trail 12 km e <strong>7,00 \u20ac<\/strong> na Caminhada 8 km; na <strong>2\u00aa Fase (de 16 de novembro a 6 de dezembro)<\/strong> passam para <strong>15,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (21 km), <strong>13,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (12 km) e <strong>10,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (8 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes devem transportar obrigatoriamente <strong>telem\u00f3vel<\/strong>, <strong>reserva ou recipiente de \u00e1gua<\/strong>, <strong>copo reutiliz\u00e1vel<\/strong> (n\u00e3o existem copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento) e <strong>lanterna<\/strong>, podendo a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o realizar controlos aleat\u00f3rios.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es premiados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit do participante inclui saco TNT, camisola oficial, seguro desportivo, acesso a banhos no final e uma <strong>rabanada<\/strong> entregue na meta como lembran\u00e7a de finisher. Nos percursos de 21 km e 12 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da Geral M\/F, Seniores, M\/F 40, M\/F 50 e M\/F 60, al\u00e9m de classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva (4 primeiros atletas de cada equipa) e trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail da Rabanada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bravos e Bravitas<\/strong>, em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Santa Maria da Feira, a Junta de Freguesia de Romariz e a Junta de Freguesia de Escariz.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail da Rabanada 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Campo de Futebol de Romariz, Romariz\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santa Maria da Feira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bravos e Bravitas\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando, onde e a que horas se realiza o Trail da Rabanada 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail da Rabanada 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026 , com partida e chegada no Campo de Futebol de Romariz , em Santa Maria da Feira (Aveiro). Os hor\u00e1rios de partida s\u00e3o: 14:30 para o Trail Longo (21 km), 14:45 para o Trail (12 km) e 15:00 para a Caminhada (8 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para o Trail da Rabanada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 6 de dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59 divididas em duas fases: na 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 15 de novembro) custam 12,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo 21 km, 10,00 \u20ac no Trail 12 km e 7,00 \u20ac na Caminhada 8 km; na 2\u00aa Fase (de 16 de novembro a 6 de dezembro) passam para 15,00 \u20ac (21 km), 13,00 \u20ac (12 km) e 10,00 \u20ac (8 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel , reserva ou recipiente de \u00e1gua , copo reutiliz\u00e1vel (n\u00e3o existem copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento) e lanterna , podendo a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o realizar controlos aleat\u00f3rios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es premiados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit do participante inclui saco TNT, camisola oficial, seguro desportivo, acesso a banhos no final e uma rabanada entregue na meta como lembran\u00e7a de finisher. Nos percursos de 21 km e 12 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da Geral M\/F, Seniores, M\/F 40, M\/F 50 e M\/F 60, al\u00e9m de classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva (4 primeiros atletas de cada equipa) e trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail da Rabanada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Bravos e Bravitas , em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Santa Maria da Feira, a Junta de Freguesia de Romariz e a Junta de Freguesia de Escariz.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69580,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68852","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-santa-maria-da-feira-aveiro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-da-rabanada.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68852","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=68852"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68852\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69582,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68852\/revisions\/69582"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"ht